OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned after sending teen
OL,4,ASnapchat images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher has been banned after a
OL,7,Fmisconduct panel concluded he used
OL,8,FSnapchat to send explicit images to a
OL,9,Fteenager.
OL,11,FWhile working as a teacher at Priory
OL,12,FRise School, a primary in Milton
OL,13,FKeynes, Ross Bullen, 38, had a Snapchat
OL,14,Fwhere he shared sexually explicit
OL,15,Fimages with thousands of people under
OL,16,Fthe name "RossAlex".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
