OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATeacher banned after sending teen
OL,4,ASnapchat images
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2023 a 16-year-old, who had
OL,7,Freceived the images, used Snapchat Maps
OL,8,Flocation data and online staff photos
OL,9,Fto identify the man, then notified the
OL,10,Fschool who reported it to the police
OL,11,Fand dismissed Bullen after an
OL,12,Finvestigation.
OL,14,FThe panel concluded that while Bullen's
OL,15,Fconduct did not constitute
OL,16,F"unacceptable professional conduct", it
OL,17,Fmay bring the profession into
OL,18,Fdisrepute.
